ELEMENTS
C  O  H  N
END

SPECIES
CO  O2  CO2  H2O  N2
END

REACTIONS    CAL/MOLE   MOLES
!
! Global CO oxidation (Eq. 20, Hassan et al. 2021 / Howard 1973)
! Rate = K * [CO] * [O2]^0.5 * [H2O]^0.5 * exp(-Eg/RT)
!
CO + 0.5 O2 => CO2          1.230E+14    0.0    29971.0
    FORD / CO   1.0 /
    FORD / O2   0.5 /
    FORD / H2O  0.5 /
END
